      en: ["The stadium was officially opened in 1975, shortly after national independence.", "It features a natural grass pitch that requires constant maintenance.", "The official capacity of the venue is listed as 6,500 spectators.", "It serves as the home stadium for the local club Sporting Praia Cruz.", "Besides football, the facility is equipped to host track and field events.", "The stadium is located in the Água Grande district, near the coastline."],
