      en: ["The building was designed by Portuguese architects during the 1950s.", "It is considered one of the finest examples of modernist colonial style in Africa.", "Upon its opening, the cinema hall was one of the most advanced in the region.", "The facade is noted for its vertical lines and symmetrical Art Deco forms.", "It is located in close proximity to the harbor and the National Museum.", "Recent years have seen several local initiatives for its full restoration."],
