      en: ["A central hub for promoting the Portuguese language and culture.", "Houses one of the largest libraries in the country.", "Features regular exhibitions by local and international artists.", "Offers scholarships and exchange programs for students.", "A significant venue for promoting cinema and theatrical arts.", "The building is located near the Avenida Marginal."],
      es: ["Parte de una red global de institutos culturales portugueses.", "La biblioteca es una de las mejores bibliotecas públicas del país.", "Fomenta activamente a jóvenes artistas santotomenses.", "Ofrece exámenes de idioma portugués certificados.", "La entrada a muchos eventos es gratuita.", "Una plataforma importante para el diálogo sobre temas postcoloniales.", "El edificio en sí es una construcción colonial renovada."],
